# Declare

Author a card locally and register it to the server with
`wyrd.cards.register(card)`. Registration is idempotent on identity; the server
rejects a changed spec at the same version.

## Shipped kinds

- [Declare a Prompt card](/how-to/declare/prompt/)
- [Declare a Model card](/how-to/declare/model/)
- [Declare a Data card](/how-to/declare/data/)

## Reserved kinds

The other thirteen card kinds (Agent, Service, Workflow, Eval, Experiment,
Drift, Audit, Policy, Trigger, Mcp, Operator, Artifact, Source) have authored
contracts and JSON Schemas, but their runtime implementation is not shipped yet.
How-to pages for these kinds will be added as each kind's contract ships.

See [Cards overview](/cards/) for the full catalog and shipping status.
